  "formal_scope": "Five differences, simultaneous point and even-window cancellation on the actual prices for a common quotient, and the conditional implication from an affordable substream and its remaining sign to stock RH.",
  "paper_scope": "For each fixed cofactor exponent below 11/26, every sufficiently large fourth-power block admits the stated capacity allocation. The allocated moving-head cost is o(sqrt(T)). The finite result has its own interval and population count.",
  "open": "The funded construction still needs a lower bound on the signed complement at every sufficiently late fourth power. No independent unconditional stock RH theorem has been obtained.",
